    "summary": "Blast. Use the target’s model count at Select Targets. Each full group of five adds one attack die, or the listed number for [BLAST X], when you gather dice. Close-Quarters Shooting prevents a MONSTER or VEHICLE from using Blast against units engaged with its own unit. The FAQ also excludes an engaged MONSTER or VEHICLE from Blast as a target.",
